### Job Portal - Job Service HTTP tests
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client
### Run requests individually; update IDs after creating records.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003
@employerId = 1
@companyId = 1
@categoryId = 1
@parentCategoryId = 1
@skillId = 1
@tagId = 1
@jobId = 1


### ==================== CATEGORIES ====================

### Create a root category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Information Technology",
  "description": "Technology and software jobs",
  "iconUrl": "https://example.com/it.png",
  "parentId": null
}

### Create a child category (update parentCategoryId first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Backend Development",
  "description": "Java, Spring Boot and APIs",
  "iconUrl": "https://example.com/backend.png",
  "parentId": {{parentCategoryId}}
}

### List active categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories

### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories/{{categoryId}}

### Update category (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "IT and Software Development",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "iconUrl": "https://example.com/it-new.png",
  "parentId": null
}

### Delete/deactivate category - run only after other tests
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/job-categories/{{categoryId}}


### ==================== SKILLS ====================
### Note: Adapt category to the exact type/enum accepted by JobSkillRequest.

### Create skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java",
  "category": "PROGRAMMING_LANGUAGE"
}

### List active skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills

### Get skill by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills/{{skillId}}

### Update skill
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills/{{skillId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Development",
  "category": "PROGRAMMING_LANGUAGE"
}

### Get skills by IDs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills/by-ids
Content-Type: application/json

[{{skillId}}]

### Delete skill - run last
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/job-skills/{{skillId}}


