### ==================== JOBS ====================
### Create categories, skills, tags, and the employer's company before creating a job.
### Replace enum values below if your project's enums use different names.

### Create draft job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java Backend Developer",
  "description": "Build Spring Boot microservices",
  "requirements": "Java 21, PostgreSQL, REST APIs",
  "responsibilities": "Develop APIs and write tests",
  "benefits": "Flexible working hours",
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "skillIds": [{{skillId}}],
  "tagIds": [{{tagId}}],
  "address": "Example Street 1",
  "city": "Tallinn",
  "state": "Harjumaa",
  "country": "Estonia",
  "zipCode": "10111",
  "minSalary": 2500,
  "maxSalary": 4500,
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "experienceLevel": "MID_LEVEL",
  "openings": 2,
  "applicationDeadLine": "2026-12-31",
  "expiredAt": "2027-01-31"
}

### Get job by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Search public jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Filter jobs (open jobs after publishing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?keyword=java&location=Tallinn

### Get jobs by company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/company/{{companyId}}

### Update draft/open job
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Java Backend Developer",
  "description": "Build and maintain Java microservices",
  "requirements": "Java 21 and Spring Boot",
  "responsibilities": "Design and maintain APIs",
  "benefits": "Remote work",
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "skillIds": [{{skillId}}],
  "tagIds": [{{tagId}}],
  "address": "Example Street 1",
  "city": "Tallinn",
  "state": "Harjumaa",
  "country": "Estonia",
  "zipCode": "10111",
  "minSalary": 3000,
  "maxSalary": 5500,
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "workMode": "REMOTE",
  "experienceLevel": "MID_LEVEL",
  "openings": 2,
  "applicationDeadLine": "2026-12-31",
  "expiredAt": "2027-01-31"
}

### Publish draft job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/publish
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### Increment application count (test only after publishing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/applications/count

### Admin - list every job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/admin

### Close open job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/close
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}

### Delete job - run last
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
X-User-Id: {{employerId}}
